/* MAX_LANGUAGE_SIZE is computed from the LARGEST .lng this build produces
 * (apps/lang/lang.make), and language_buffer in apps/language.c is a static
 * array of exactly that size. Building all 47 translations therefore costs
 * this target 27,759 bytes of SRAM to hold a language it will never load.
 *
 * yp3box is the only 512 KB target in the tree and needs that memory for the
 * PCM ring, so it builds English only. Every other target is unaffected -
 * this list is preprocessed with the target defines, and only YP3BOX takes
 * the reduced branch. Loading a .lng from the card still works; there just
 * are not any others shipped in the zip. */
